es work-life balance, and offers professional growth opportunities in the realms of dermatology, preventative healthcare, health technology and AI.We are currently looking for doctors who can work from 17 hours per week up to full-time.What You’ll Deliver in the First 6–12 Months Conduct thorough health screenings and assessments.Translate complex diagnostic results into actionable insights.Craft personalised plans for lifestyle change to improve health outcomes.Offer holistic advice on a spectrum of health conditions.Liaise with our members’ doctors for seamless patient care coordination.Collaborate with our multidisciplinary team to coordinate and improve patient care.Stay abreast of the latest developments in medical diagnostics and preventive health.Champion patient education, inspiring proactive health management.Contribute to clinical quality improvement activity.Participate in our research programs.Collaborate with teams across Neko to develop and improve our technology.Minimum QualificationsYou are a registered doctor (legitimerad läkare).You enjoy a fast pace, are confident in your role, and challenges excite you.You are compelled to deliver high-quality results in everything you do.You are curious and dedicated to continuous learning.You have a solution-oriented mindset.You speak fluent in both Swedish and English.We offer a dynamic work environment with a high degree of autonomy that fosters growth and development. If you are passionate about building a better healthcare system for everyone and you thrive in a fast-paced environment, we would love to hear from you. Interviews are ongoing, so don’t hesitate to send in your application today!About Titles At NekoWe use a simplified internal title framework that prioritises clarity over hierarchy, so internal titles may differ from market‑facing role titles. Scope, impact and level of the role are fully aligned and will be clearly discussed throughout the process.Hiring ProcessCandidates progress from application and structured screening through thoughtfully designed interviews culminating in a formal offer and final pre-employment checks before joining the team.Equal Opportunity & Inclusion StatementNeko Health is committed to inclusive hiring and member-first care. We welcome candidates from all backgrounds and encourage you to request reasonable adjustments to support your application. Show more Show less Yrkesnivå Mellannivå Anställningstyp Heltid Befattning Vård Branscher Sjukhus och hälsovård Referenser fördubblar dina chanser att få komma på intervju på Neko Health Se vilka du känner Få aviseringar om nya jobb som Läkare i Stockholm. Logga in för att skapa jobbavisering Liknande jobb Företagsläkare / Specialist i allmänmedicin Företagsläkare / Specialist i allmänmedicin Globenhälsan AB Greater Stockholm Metropolitan Area 2 dagar sedan Legitimerad läkare sökes till Testmottagningen.se Legitimerad läkare sökes till Testmottagningen.se zample™ Stockholm 4 dagar sedan ST-läkare ST-läkare Doktor.Se Stockholm 2 veckor sedan Läkare till Företagshälsa Läkare till Företagshälsa Falck Stockholm 4 dagar sedan Specialistläkare i allmänmedicin Specialistläkare i allmänmedicin Doktor.Se Stockholm 1 vecka sedan Allmänspecialist till Kry vårdcentral Sundbyberg Allmänspecialist till Kry vårdcentral Sundbyberg Kry Stockholm 6 månader sedan Specialist i allmänmedicin med möjlighet till ledningsuppdrag Specialist i allmänmedicin med möjlighet till ledningsuppdrag Kry Stockholm 1 månad sedan Legitimerade läkare sökes till Region Stockholms fristående BT-program Legitimerade läkare sökes till Region Stockholms fristående BT-program Region Stockholm Stockholm 1 vecka sedan Specialist i allmänmedicin Specialist i allmänmedicin Capio Sverige Årsta Havsbad 1 vecka sedan Medical Director, Sweden Medical Director, Sweden Neko Health Stockholm 1 vecka sedan Distriktsläkare och medicinskt ledningsansvarig, Hallonbergens vårdcentral Distriktsläkare och medicinskt ledningsansvarig, Hallonbergen